OL,3,GNEWSA'Women are still victimised and
OL,4,Afeel unsafe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarches have been held to highlight
OL,7,Fviolence against women and girls - an
OL,8,Fissue that is called "an everyday
OL,9,Freality".
OL,11,FReclaim the Night in Ipswich and Bury
OL,12,FSt Edmunds coincided with the national
OL,13,FWhite Ribbon Day campaign, which has
OL,14,Fthe theme this year of It Takes All of
OL,15,FUs.
OL,17,FThe Ipswich event was organised by the
OL,18,FUniversity of Suffolk Students' Union.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
